aethersx2
=========

This directory is a Buildroot recipe. It does not relicense upstream.
Software built by this recipe: prebuilt binary from ROCKNIX/packages
Declared SPDX / license field: LGPL-3.0
Upstream / origin: https://github.com/ROCKNIX/packages

Recipe files (.mk, Config.in, start_aethersx2.sh) are packaging for Zlyme.
The tarball is a PCSX2/AetherSX2 build. Qt6 on this image is EGLFS.
